WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,820
From the time I took my mother to the hospital

2
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:06,380
The doctor already told me

3
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:08,570
My mother is basically hopeless

4
00:00:08,570 --> 00:00:10,890
Even if they choose to undergo surgery to save

5
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:13,410
The probability of success is almost zero

6
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:15,570
But I still chose to have surgery

7
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:17,330
I hope a miracle happens

8
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:20,140
So I went to draw money

9
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:21,440
Just

10
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,560
She didn't wait until I came back with the money

11
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:27,220
I've already left after performing the surgery on her.

12
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,650
Please have your condolences

13
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:29,970
People have gone

14
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:31,570
I don’t think Auntie will blame you

15
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:34,490
I can see that you are very filial, right?

16
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:39,740
Haven't been back for ten years

17
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,530
Almost no contact

18
00:00:41,530 --> 00:00:42,770
Parents are bullied

19
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:44,130
Died of illness successively

20
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:46,070
Tingting Chengjin is so good

21
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:48,150
I'm out of school too, if I hadn't left

22
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:49,840
Maybe it can protect them

23
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,590
But there are no ifs in life

24
00:00:51,590 --> 00:00:53,070
Are you going to defend your country?

25
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:56,470
Uncle and aunt won't blame you

26
00:00:56,470 --> 00:00:59,010
Do you have anything to ask?

27
00:00:59,010 --> 00:01:00,530
But I want to say thank you even more

28
00:01:00,530 --> 00:01:02,510
And I'm sorry

29
00:01:02,510 --> 00:01:03,950
My dad said it was robbery

30
00:01:03,950 --> 00:01:06,160
The law enforcement team arrived and arrested the person

31
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:07,400
I was in a coma

32
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,060
I didn't know it was kidnapping

33
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:10,460
I didn’t even know it was you who saved me
